WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
The leadership scorecard connects
an outcome to evidence and a decision.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.800
Net effort informs whether
capacity can be redeployed.

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:10.720
Fault detection and escaped defects
test whether quality is holding.

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:15.960
Results across teams show whether shared
services deserve further investment.

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:20.080
Denial and recovery exercises
inform authority limits.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:24.800
Every readout needs scope, sample,
period, costs and uncertainty.

00:00:25.093 --> 00:00:29.840
An attractive aggregate result should
not hide a failed critical scenario.
